This product is a Go implementation of the server side of Cap
(https://capjs.js.org), by Tiago (https://github.com/tiagozip/cap),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Protocol behaviour, constants, key derivation labels, wire formats and the
instrumentation client script are ported from:

  - @cap.js/server 4.0.5  (stateful format-1 challenges and tokens)
  - capjs-core 0.1.1/0.1.2 (signed format-1 and format-2 challenges,
    scopes, nonce consumption, RSW time-lock minting, instrumentation)

The legacy format-1 verification loop was originally derived from
github.com/ackcoder/go-cap v1.1.4 (Apache-2.0) via the CapAPI project.

Test fixtures under testdata/ were produced by running the official
JavaScript packages listed above.
